From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 03:44:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] j604: media: apple: ave: carry Aurora's encoder
 driver, not the J604 copy

The J604 series carried its own copy of the AVE driver: Aurora's driver
as it was when the T8132 work began, plus that work. Each rebase onto
Aurora kept the copy, so the J604 build lost everything Aurora added
since: the MCTF filter node, compressed 4:2:0 surfaces, the 6070
firmware, the M4 Max firmware ID (#1677), recovery and the size checks.

Take drivers/media/platform/apple/ave as it is in integration/aurora
abd6d4a09f. The T8132 commits follow on top of it unchanged, so the
encoder's own code becomes Aurora's, and only the T8132 identity and
its behaviour changes are carried.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
